+        "four-dimensional inner-product work plus O(n^6) worst-case "
+        "backtracking; at the shipping n=16 preset it is measured by selftest, "
+        "whereas template normalization uses at most 192 exact additions or "
+        "sign changes before a six-way set intersection."
