-
-The four failed attacks are an L1-coordinate outlier, reverse-list one-pass greedy,
-256 uniform restarts, and the unrotated-24-cell ansatz.
-
-## Oracle loop and G9 arms
-
-The official bare run stopped before a valid attempt because the OpenRouter key had
