-| hinted | 0 / 0 | attempted in isolation; four provider errors |
-| placebo | 0 / 0 | attempted in isolation; four provider errors |
-
-`hinted - placebo` is therefore not measurable yet. The isolated error transcripts
-are retained as `g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl` and `g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl`. After
-the key is restored, rerun each arm in its own scratch directory; do not reuse the
-result directory, because `harden.py` opens its transcript with mode `w`.
-
-## Use
-
-```python
